Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tớ là Sōryū Asuka Langley, hân hạnh làm quen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Fly me to the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And let me play\Namong the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.19,0:22:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Let me see\Nwhat Spring is like
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ On Jupiter and Mars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.99,0:22:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\Nhold my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\Ndarling, kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Fill my heart\Nwith song
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And let me sing\Nforevermore
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You are all I long for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ All I worship\Nand adore
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\Nplease be true
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:23:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\NI love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I love you
